        "title": "Add preview edge helpers and community site listing type",
        "summary": "The shared `common` package introduces `common/src/desktop-cloud/preview-edge.ts` to support sandbox preview hosting. This module exports `CLOUD_PREVIEW_EDGE_DOMAINS` and functions such as `previewEdgeHost` and `previewEdgeDomain` to construct and identify preview hostnames under the `freebuff.site` and `freebuffweb.site` zones. It also includes `isAgent37EmbedHost` to recognize Agent 37 embed links based on their hostname pattern. Additionally, `CommunitySiteListing` is added to the community contract in `common/src/community/contract.ts` to represent the status of a site's listing in the community feed.",
